{"id":"58e47ffb16d63410","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-set-of-fibration.md","title":"逻辑 PER 的范畴","display":"df-set-of-fibration — 逻辑 PER 的范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-set-of-fibration","display":"df-set-of-fibration — 逻辑 PER 的范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","[[16-df-substitution]]","[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Definition 6.1.1, pp. 374–375 (PDF 394–395); typed reindexing expansion","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-set-of-fibration"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-set-of-fibration"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-of-fibration — 逻辑 PER 的范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 6.1.1, pp. 374–375 (PDF 394–395); typed reindexing expansion"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-set-of-fibration</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a>。固定 cleavage、基底有限积、纤维终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_L\">\\(\\top_L\\)</span> 与二元积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_L\">\\(\\wedge_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{A,B}\\dashv\\pi_{A,B}^*\">\\(\\Sigma_{A,B}\\dashv\\pi_{A,B}^*\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a> 的同一伴随族。所有范畴和构造在足够大的宇宙中编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\">\\(I,J,K\\)</span> 是基范畴对象，不是宿主集合的元素论域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J\\times J}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{J\\times J}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{K\\times K}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{K\\times K}\\)</span> 是候选关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 是相应积上纤维对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{ij}=\\langle\\pi_i,\\pi_j\\rangle\">\\(\\pi_{ij}=\\langle\\pi_i,\\pi_j\\rangle\\)</span> 为指定有限积的投影；多重积按下式出现的坐标顺序固定括号与投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\">\\(\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sw}_I=\\langle\\pi_2,\\pi_1\\rangle:I\\times I\\to I\\times I\">\\(\\operatorname{sw}_I=\\langle\\pi_2,\\pi_1\\rangle:I\\times I\\to I\\times I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_L\">\\(\\leq_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{p,I,J}\">\\(\\sim_{p,I,J}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_p(I,\\rho)\">\\(E_p(I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RelComp}\">\\(\\operatorname{RelComp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(p)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(p)\\)</span> 在下文定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[F]_{I,J}\">\\([F]_{I,J}\\)</span> 表示由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{p,I,J}\">\\(\\sim_{p,I,J}\\)</span> 取的等价类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组范畴谓词。</li>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\leq_LY\">\\(X\\leq_LY\\)</span> 的定义中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_L\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\sim_{p,I,J}G\">\\(F\\sim_{p,I,J}G\\)</span> 的两个输入均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nX\\leq_LY&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_L(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nF\\sim_{p,I,J}G&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow F\\leq_{I\\times J}G\\land G\\leq_{I\\times J}F,\\\\\nE_p(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\delta_I^*\\rho,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\n\\land\\rho\\leq_{I\\times I}\\operatorname{sw}_I^*\\rho\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\pi_{12}^*\\rho\\wedge_{I^3}\\pi_{23}^*\\rho\n\\leq_{I^3}\\pi_{13}^*\\rho.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nX\\leq_LY&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_L(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nF\\sim_{p,I,J}G&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow F\\leq_{I\\times J}G\\land G\\leq_{I\\times J}F,\\\\\nE_p(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\delta_I^*\\rho,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\n\\land\\rho\\leq_{I\\times I}\\operatorname{sw}_I^*\\rho\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\pi_{12}^*\\rho\\wedge_{I^3}\\pi_{23}^*\\rho\n\\leq_{I^3}\\pi_{13}^*\\rho.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi_{12}^*\\rho\\wedge\\pi_{34}^*\\sigma\\wedge\\pi_{13}^*F\n\\leq_{I\\times I\\times J\\times J}\\pi_{24}^*F\\\\\n&amp;\\land F\\leq_{I\\times J}\\pi_1^*E_p(I,\\rho)\\wedge\\pi_2^*E_p(J,\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi_{12}^*F\\wedge\\pi_{13}^*F\n\\leq_{I\\times J\\times J}\\pi_{23}^*\\sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land E_p(I,\\rho)\\leq_I\\Sigma_{I,J}F.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi_{12}^*\\rho\\wedge\\pi_{34}^*\\sigma\\wedge\\pi_{13}^*F\n\\leq_{I\\times I\\times J\\times J}\\pi_{24}^*F\\\\\n&amp;\\land F\\leq_{I\\times J}\\pi_1^*E_p(I,\\rho)\\wedge\\pi_2^*E_p(J,\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\pi_{12}^*F\\wedge\\pi_{13}^*F\n\\leq_{I\\times J\\times J}\\pi_{23}^*\\sigma\\\\\n&amp;\\land E_p(I,\\rho)\\leq_I\\Sigma_{I,J}F.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{I,J,K}&amp;\\coloneqq(I\\times K)\\times J,\\\\\na&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1^{I,K}\\pi_1^{I\\times K,J},\n\\qquad b\\coloneqq\\pi_2^{I\\times K,J},\n\\qquad c\\coloneqq\\pi_2^{I,K}\\pi_1^{I\\times K,J},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RelComp}_{p,I,J,K}(G,F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\Sigma_{I\\times K,J}\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle^*F\\wedge_{T_{I,J,K}}\\langle b,c\\rangle^*G\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_{I,J,K}&amp;\\coloneqq(I\\times K)\\times J,\\\\\na&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1^{I,K}\\pi_1^{I\\times K,J},\n\\qquad b\\coloneqq\\pi_2^{I\\times K,J},\n\\qquad c\\coloneqq\\pi_2^{I,K}\\pi_1^{I\\times K,J},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RelComp}_{p,I,J,K}(G,F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\Sigma_{I\\times K,J}\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle^*F\\wedge_{T_{I,J,K}}\\langle b,c\\rangle^*G\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,\\rho)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\\}/{\\sim_{p,I,J}},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,C\\rangle\\mid A,B\\in O\\land C\\in\\mathcal H(A,B)\\},\\\\\ns_S\\langle A,B,C\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_S\\langle A,B,C\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_S(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\rho),(I,\\rho),[\\rho]_{I,I}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_S(\\langle(J,\\sigma),(K,\\tau),[G]_{J,K}\\rangle,\n\\langle(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma),[F]_{I,J}\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\rho),(K,\\tau),[\\operatorname{RelComp}_{p,I,J,K}(G,F)]_{I,K}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Set}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s_S,t_S,e_S,c_S\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Set}(p))&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,\\rho)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\\}/{\\sim_{p,I,J}},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,C\\rangle\\mid A,B\\in O\\land C\\in\\mathcal H(A,B)\\},\\\\\ns_S\\langle A,B,C\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_S\\langle A,B,C\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_S(I,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\rho),(I,\\rho),[\\rho]_{I,I}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_S(\\langle(J,\\sigma),(K,\\tau),[G]_{J,K}\\rangle,\n\\langle(I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma),[F]_{I,J}\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\rho),(K,\\tau),[\\operatorname{RelComp}_{p,I,J,K}(G,F)]_{I,K}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Set}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s_S,t_S,e_S,c_S\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Set}(p))&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>四个功能关系条件依次为外延、严格、单值、全定义；均为相应纤维中的箭头存在条件。它们是 Definition 6.1.1 的内部逻辑公式的重索引展开，不把基范畴对象当集合。参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\">\\(I,J\\)</span> 显式保留；固定这些参数后，可把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{PER}_p(I,\\rho)\\)</span> 简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PER}_p(\\rho)\">\\(\\mathrm{PER}_p(\\rho)\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FuncRel}_p((I,\\rho),(J,\\sigma);F)\\)</span> 简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FuncRel}_{\\rho,\\sigma}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FuncRel}_{\\rho,\\sigma}(F)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>纤维为预序，互相有箭头是等价关系。重索引、合取、存在量词均单调，故复合对等价类代表无关。复合的严格性由两个因子的严格性得到；外延性沿两个因子传递；单值性先以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的单值性比较中间值，再以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的外延和单值性比较末值；全定义性由两次存在量化及 Frobenius 得到。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 自身是功能关系。严格性给出复合单位的一向蕴涵，取反身于已存在元素的中间见证给出另一向；存在量词 BC、Frobenius 和合取结合律将两种三重复合都化为同一双存在公式，故商上有严格单位律和结合律。这给出所声明六元组的范畴公理。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 6.1.1, pp. 374–375（PDF 394–395）。这里仅构造正则纤维化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(p)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(p)\\)</span>；成为 topos 另需高阶结构，不从本页推出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed"